dth: 0px;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<strong style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            关于\n           </span>\n<span>\n            Las Margaritas\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<strong style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\">\n             玛格丽特庄园位于沃坎产区，海拔1300米，总共种植了 26 公顷咖啡，其中只有 7 公顷是瑰夏。其余种植的是帕卡马拉（13 公顷）和卡杜艾（7 公顷）。庄园于 2016 年开始种植咖啡。咖啡生产只是庄园业务的一小部分，他们还拥有牧场和牛奶加工厂，庄园的大部分土地都保持自然状态，从而保护天然水资源。\n            </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SFBveiaVSyQZiaiaEYLDSELQFBe3PeK4Tic5Wx6VvwHPniamrhu0viagwricJ2m7POUibBpG9yvOn0uMKduQ/640?wx_fmt=webp&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px 0px 0em;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: auto;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: auto;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           更多咖啡豆选购，请关注淘宝店铺哦～\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outl